  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "體育－瑜珈",
    "sub_ename": "YO GA",
    "describe_ch": "瑜珈是一種引導人類身心靈的結合，從活動中體驗我們日常生活中對周遭的人、事、物的覺察與慈悲。課程包括體位法、呼吸和放鬆技巧，這些技巧主要是促進肌肉、骨骼、神經系統、腺體及內內部器官的健康。",
    "describe_eh": "Yoga is a means of working a level where the activities of the body 、mind and spirit function together harmoniously as a way to experience wakefulness and compassion in our daily lives. This course covers system of training that uses physical postures, breathing and relaxation techniques. These techniques benefit the muscular and skeletal body as well as the nervous system glands and vital rogans. The aim is to promote vibrant health.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "藉由瑜珈的呼吸法與體位法的配合，瞭解如何和身體溝通，達到身心靈的融合、身心健康之改善，以提高免疫系統",
      "describe_en": "Cooperate with law of body posture one with the breath law of Yoga, understand how to communicate with the body, reach body and mind efficacious mixing. Physically and mentally healthy improvement, in order to improve the immune system.\n"
    }
